@@ -14,18 +14,24 @@ Quizzy is a Rails 8.1 application using SQLite (`storage/`), Propshaft, Importma
 
 ## Data Model
 
-- `Quiz` (`quizzes`): `title` (required, whitespace-normalized), `number_of_winners` (integer >= 1, default `3`, editable via Quiz Settings). Has many `games`, `questions` ordered by `(position, id)`, and `active_questions` (`where(active: true)`).
